st... provide the VAA with written assurance"} {:name "qualified independent consultant", :role "Investigator/Consultant", :evidence "the VAA may require the Contractor to obtain, at its own cost and expense a qualified independent consultant to investigate the Adverse Environmental Condition"}], :financials [{:item "Environmental investigation and remediation costs", :amount_or_terms "At Contractor's own cost and expense", :evidence "the VAA may require the Contractor to obtain, at its own cost and expense a qualified independent consultant to investigate the Adverse Environmental Condition"}], :summary_points ["The Contractor must provide annual written assurance of compliance with Environmental Requirements and the absence of Adverse Environmental Conditions." "If an Adverse Environmental Condition occurs, the Contractor must immediately notify the VAA and provide a remediation plan for government approval." "The VAA has the right to require the Contractor to hire an independent consultant at the Contractor's expense if remediation efforts are deemed insufficient." "The VAA is authorized to make inquiries with governmental agencies regarding the Contractor’s environmental compliance and any ongoing remediation works."]} {:dates [], :entities [{:name "Victoria Airport Authority", :role "Authority / VAA", :evidence "VICTORIA AIRPORT AUTHORITY - REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS"} {:name "VAA", :role "Authority / Indemnified Party", :evidence "The Contractor will indemnify and save harmless the VAA"} {:name "Contractor", :role "Service Provider / Indemnifying Party", :evidence "The Contractor will indemnify and save harmless the VAA"}], :financials [{:item "Indemnity for Environmental Liability", :amount_or_terms "Contractor will indemnify VAA from all liability, costs, claims, or proceedings (civil or criminal) arising from Environmental Liability resulting from Contractor's conduct.", :evidence "The Contractor will indemnify and save harmless the VAA from any and all liabilit