ch licenses, permits or approvals"}], :summary_points ["VAA and the Crown are exempted from liability regarding utility interruptions, theft of contractor property, or theft of funds held in trust." "The Contractor assumes all risks related to liability limitations and agrees to indemnify the VAA and the Crown." "The Contractor is responsible for obtaining all necessary federal, provincial, and municipal licenses and permits required for the work." "Contract performance must comply with all applicable environmental, health, and safety laws/codes, following the most stringent provision when regulations overlap."]}}, :duration-ms 3603, :usage {:prompt-tokens 1168, :completion-tokens 555, :total-tokens 1723}, :inputs #:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors{:map-each-index 133, :map-each-parent #uuid "621004b8-f33b-41f9-a358-7262f91a88d9"}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "c46d393b-eb8a-4120-accf-5eca706684c4", :sheet-id #uuid "120307da-6e8f-4362-aaa2-56bae5f6aa7f", :timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-21T16:25:05.159530-05:00"} {:tick-id #uuid "ad74ce10-75ff-4da7-9deb-78e649764531", :writes {:page-facts {:dates [], :entities [{:name "VICTORIA AIRPORT AUTHORITY", :role "Owner/Issuer (VAA)", :contact nil, :evidence "VICTORIA AIRPORT AUTHORITY - REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS"} {:name "Contractor", :role "Service Provider", :contact nil, :evidence "The VAA will provide to the Contractor a sufficient number of keys"}], :financials [], :summary_points ["The Victoria Airport Authority (VAA) provides keys to the Contractor for access to parking equipment, buildings, and booths." "All keys remain the sole property of the VAA and duplication is prohibited without express authorization." "Contractors must safeguard keys, report loss or theft immediately, and surrender keys upon contract termination or expiration."]}}, :duration-ms 1961, :usage {:prompt-tokens 861, :completion-tokens 224, :total-tokens 1085}, :inputs #:ai.obney.orc.orc-service.core.todo-processors{:map-each