oposals." "All staff must be legally able to work in Canada, be fluent in English, and be paid above the B.C. provincial minimum wage."]} {:dates [], :entities [{:name "Victoria Airport Authority", :role "Authority / Issuing Body", :evidence "VICTORIA AIRPORT AUTHORITY - REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS"} {:name "Canadian Transportation Agency (CTA)", :role "Auditor", :evidence "periodic audits conducted by the Canadian Transportation Agency (CTA)"} {:name "VAA", :role "Authority", :evidence "Additional VAA-required and administered training includes"} {:name "Victoria International Airport", :role "Airport Location", :evidence "promote inclusivity at Victoria International Airport"}], :financials [{:item "Training Expenses", :amount_or_terms "At the successful Proponent’s expense", :evidence "Training is to be provided at the successful Proponent’s expense"} {:item "Revenue Responsibility", :amount_or_terms "Proponent accepts responsibility for all Revenues collected", :evidence "will accept responsibility for all Revenues collected on behalf of the Authority"} {:item "Liability", :amount_or_terms "Responsibility for property damage and injury", :evidence "will accept responsibility for... incidents of property damage and injury that occur within areas of their responsibility."}], :summary_points ["The successful proponent must provide comprehensive training (Customer Service, Sensitivity, Technical, and Security) at their own expense." "New staff are required to complete a minimum of 12 hours of 'on the job' training before being placed in the field." "Proponents must submit a customer complaint resolution process and maintain an onsite manager for immediate response to service issues." "The contractor is responsible for all revenues collected and any property damage or injuries occurring within their areas of responsibility."]} {:dates [{:name "Revenue and Sales Taxes forward deadline", :date nil, :time nil, :timezone nil, :evidence "All Revenues and Sales Taxes collected w